  mac6_a1  0.3
  mac7_d1  #21
  mac7_a1  0.3
  mac8_d1  #3
  mac8_a1  0.006
  # Two filters side by side: the first holds still and the second wobbles in
  # eighths. The wobble knob fades from one to the other, so a plain bass
